{"path":"ranges/iota_view/size","title":"std::ranges::iota_view<W, Bound>::size","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::iota_view&lt;W, Bound&gt;::</span>size","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view/size","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the size of the view if the view is bounded.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/same_as\"><span class=\"kw2951\">std::<span class=\"me2\">same_as</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>W, Bound<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*advanceable*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>W<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">||</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*is-integer-like*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>W<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*is-integer-like*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Bound<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">||</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/sized_sentinel_for\"><span class=\"kw2881\">std::<span class=\"me2\">sized_sentinel_for</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Bound, W<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the size of the view if the view is bounded.\n</p><p>For the definitions of <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*advanceable*/</span></span> and <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*is-integer-like*/</span></span>, see <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view/iterator#advanceable\">advanceable</a></i></code> and <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/is-integer-like\"><code><i>is-integer-like</i></code></a> respectively.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If any of <code>W</code> and <code>Bound</code> is not a <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/is-integer-like\">integer-like type</a>, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges#to-unsigned-like\">to-unsigned-like</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#bound\">bound_</a></i></code><code>&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span></span><code>&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#value\">value_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>Otherwise, returns <code class=\"t-c\">\n<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#value\">value_</a></i></code><code>&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span></span><br>\n<code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><br>\n<code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#bound\">bound_</a></i></code><code>&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span></span><br>\n<code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges#to-unsigned-like\">to-unsigned-like</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#value\">value_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span></span><code>&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges#to-unsigned-like\">to-unsigned-like</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#bound\">bound_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span></span><br>\n<code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges#to-unsigned-like\">to-unsigned-like</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#bound\">bound_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span></span><code>&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges#to-unsigned-like\">to-unsigned-like</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#value\">value_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span><br>\n<code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span></span><br>\n<code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges#to-unsigned-like\">to-unsigned-like</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#bound\">bound_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span></span><code>&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges#to-unsigned-like\">to-unsigned-like</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view#value\">value_</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span>\n</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> initial_value<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, bound<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> i<span class=\"br0\">{</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view\"><span class=\"kw2932\">views::<span class=\"me2\">iota</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>initial_value, bound<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> bound <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> initial_value and i.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> u<span class=\"br0\">{</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iota_view\"><span class=\"kw2932\">views::<span class=\"me2\">iota</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// assert(u.size()); // Error: size() is not present since “u” is unbounded</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3610\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3610</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td><code>size</code> might reject integer-class types\n</td>\n<td>accept if possible\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::size</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> returns an integer equal to the size of a range<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(customization point object)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/ssize\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::ssize</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> returns a signed integer equal to the size of a range<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(customization point object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/iota_view","title":"std::ranges::views::iota, std::ranges::iota_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::iota_view<W, Bound>::size","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Returns the size of the view if the view is bounded."},{"label":"Return value","note":"If any of W and Bound is not a integer-like type, returns to-unsigned-like (bound_ - value_ )."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"ranges::size","note":"returns an integer equal to the size of a range"},{"label":"ranges::ssize","note":"returns a signed integer equal to the size of a range"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":197,"codeBlockCount":1}
